  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "75b1d2e1-4a68-4b35-bf53-81c5034a8a23",
    "name": "📌 ElevenLabs API",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"ElevenLabs is an AI audio research and deployment company.\"\n\nElevenLabs builds its own text-to-speech, speech-to-text and music models. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Speech & audio**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- ElevenLabs Account: [https://elevenlabs.io/app/home](https://elevenlabs.io/app/home)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `elevenlabs_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:elevenlabs_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://elevenlabs.io/docs/api-reference/introduction](https://elevenlabs.io/docs/api-reference/introduction)\n    \n- Models: [https://elevenlabs.io/docs/models](https://elevenlabs.io/docs/models)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
